# Shared Library Enforcement
RULE: Search unified libraries before implementing. If found: use it. If not: add to library first, then use.
WHY: Prevents code duplication and enforces canonical implementations.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/unified-libraries/dependency-matrix.md, .cursor/rules/search-before-implementing.mdc
DO: Use unified-cloud-services (get_storage_client, get_secret_with_fallback, BaseDependencyChecker); unified-domain-services (InstrumentsDomainClient); unified-config-interface (UnifiedCloudConfig)
NEVER: Create local DependencyChecker, duplicate storage/secret logic, reimplement domain validation
